SUMMARY:Global Gateways Meet & Greet in Bloomington
DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to our Meet &amp\; Greet with IU's 
 Global Gateways (https://global.iu.edu/presence/gateways/index.html) on T
 hursday\, July 23 from 5 pm. Whether you have worked with one of the Gate
 ways before or have been meaning to find out more about Gateways\, we'd l
 ove to welcome you to an afternoon at IU Bloomington Ferguson Internation
 al Center\, 421-423!  The event will start out with a brief overview of I
 U's five Global Gateways and how they serve IU faculty\, students\, and a
 lumni. There will be plenty of time for general questions about the Gatew
 ay network as well as opportunities to meet local team members from the A
 SEAN\, Ghana\, India\, Europe and Mexico Gateways who will be present at 
 the event.ASEAN GatewayWanlaya (Koi) PittayapitakProgram Manager      Gha
 na GatewayAbigail Opong-TettehProgram Manager      India GatewayZafeena S
 uresh        Director              &#160\;              &#160\;          
     &#160\;              &#160\;      Minu Thomas        Program Manager 
      Europe GatewayAnnabell TürkDirector              &#160\;           
