 titioner-led partnership that allows the Hamilton Lugar School to provide
  direct analysis for the U.S. Department of State. This isn't just a rese
 arch project—it's a chance to consult on urgent global challenges\, fro
 m climate security to digital freedom\, directly from Bloomington.</p><p 
