 lass="citation-143">Serving 14 years in the</span><span class="citation-1
 43">Senior Executive Service</span><span class="citation-143">within the 
 Department of State's Bureau of Population\, Refugees\, and Migration (PR
 M)\, Paula oversaw budgets exceeding</span><span class="citation-143">$4 
 billion</span><span class="citation-143">for global disaster and refugee 
 assistance</span>.</h4><ul data-path-to-node="23"><li><p data-path-to-nod
 e="23\,0\,0">      The Highlights:    </p><ul data-path-to-node="23"><li>
 <p data-path-to-node="23\,0\,0"><span class="citation-142">First American
  Rapporteur for the UN High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR)</span>.    
     </p><ul data-path-to-node="23\,0\,1"><li><p id="p-rc_668c47d0e5884af8
 -109" data-path-to-node="23\,0\,1\,1\,0"><span class="citation-141">Led i
 nteragency strategy across the Department of State and USAID</span>.     
        </p></li><li><p id="p-rc_668c47d0e5884af8-110" data-path-to-node="
 23\,0\,1\,2\,0"><span class="citation-140">Helped set global standards fo
 r international refugee protection across Africa and worldwide</span>.   
          </p></li><li><p id="p-rc_668c47d0e5884af8-111" data-path-to-node
 ="23\,0\,1\,3\,0"><span class="citation-139">Recipient of the Secretary o
 f State's</span><span class="citation-139">Career Achievement Award</span
 >.            </p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>
