 hen you arrive.A small handbag may be carried at your side. Backpacks and
  large bags will need to be stored before touring. Learn more aboutmuseum
  guidelines.If you park in the IMU parking lot\, Guest Services can valid
 ate your parking voucher for a discount.Read aboutwhere to find us and wh
 ere to park\,
